1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,720
A sound soul dwells within a sound mind and a sound body.

2
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:23,520
Hurry. You must hurry, Stein. It's time to shed your fake skin.

3
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:27,160
Give in and do what must be done.

4
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:31,580
Look for the light. The way out is up ahead.

5
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:33,700
Stop right there, Stein.

6
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:40,780
Where do you think you're going? We should be locked in the laboratory.

7
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:44,280
That's what I'm doing, trying to find my way back.

8
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:47,700
The fog is too thick, and I think I've lost my way.

9
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:52,080
You have. The madness is taking over.

10
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:54,720
I don't understand. What are you talking about?

11
00:00:57,160 --> 00:01:01,040
Haven't you realized it yet, Stein? I am the law's hound.

12
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:04,680
I guard this door so no one with a taint of madness can pass through.

13
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:07,800
You had better not come any closer.

14
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:23,100
What's happening?

15
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:43,060
I'm falling down to my shadow

16
00:01:43,060 --> 00:01:46,480
息をひそめて

17
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:50,040
待っている that dream life

18
00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:52,060
Don't scare me

19
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:55,040
君が望めば

20
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:58,660
どんな世界も

21
00:01:58,660 --> 00:02:02,820
その目に映せるから

22
00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:06,960
See you in your dreams, yeah, baby

23
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:14,220
怖い夢だとしても

24
00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:17,880
テレブル君のために

25
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:20,780
星を裂き

26
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:23,680
飾り付けた

27
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,340
Black paper

28
00:02:25,340 --> 00:02:29,240
知りてくれたなら

29
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:33,980
When you're lost, you're young

30
00:02:33,980 --> 00:02:37,240
Forever with your soul

31
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:41,240
見上げば輝く

32
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:44,500
Dina, you're worth me

33
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:57,600
I wonder where everyone is

34
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:59,760
They canceled morning classes

35
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:01,760
since no one showed up

36
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:04,280
That bunch of cowards

37
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:07,400
They're probably too afraid of the madness to come outside

38
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:09,120
I bet they're all at home right now

39
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,840
hiding under their beds like babies

40
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:13,320
But there's no need to be scared

41
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:14,760
Not with me here

42
00:03:14,760 --> 00:03:17,220
I'll tear that Kishin apart in a second

43
00:03:17,220 --> 00:03:19,180
It'll take a whole second

44
00:03:19,180 --> 00:03:20,420
You're losing your edge

45
00:03:20,420 --> 00:03:21,900
Hi, Sol

46
00:03:21,900 --> 00:03:22,800
Yo

47
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:27,420
You'll tear your pants

48
00:03:27,420 --> 00:03:28,620
Once you see the Kishin

49
00:03:28,620 --> 00:03:29,640
Oh, shut up

50
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:31,400
Maka's not with you?

51
00:03:31,780 --> 00:03:32,740
Nope, she isn't

52
00:03:32,740 --> 00:03:34,740
She won't be coming later either

53
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:37,300
She says she can't concentrate

54
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:39,880
She's too worried about Krona and the nutty professor

55
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:44,860
Hang in a little longer

56
00:03:44,860 --> 00:03:47,700
They let Medusa go, didn't they?

57
00:03:48,340 --> 00:03:49,040
After that

58
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:51,840
What excuse can they have for keeping you locked up?

59
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,060
Yeah

60
00:03:53,060 --> 00:03:55,820
But what's going on with Professor Stein?

61
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,480
Has he come back yet?

62
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:01,220
Please tell me

63
00:04:01,220 --> 00:04:05,740
Don't you think Professor Stein's disappearance has something to do with Lady Medusa?

64
00:04:07,420 --> 00:04:08,620
It's possible

65
00:04:08,620 --> 00:04:12,200
But you don't need to be worried about that

66
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:14,560
It's Professor Stein

67
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:16,580
He's tougher than he looks

68
00:04:16,580 --> 00:04:18,700
He'll come back to us

69
00:04:21,840 --> 00:04:23,500
Call off the search?

70
00:04:24,060 --> 00:04:25,100
But why?

71
00:04:25,820 --> 00:04:27,340
He's already left the city

72
00:04:27,340 --> 00:04:29,640
The way things are right now

73
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:32,220
We can't afford to send anyone else to look

74
00:04:32,220 --> 00:04:35,780
But it's so obvious what he's doing

75
00:04:35,780 --> 00:04:38,480
He's gone after Medusa

76
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:41,380
If so, it's even worse than we thought

77
00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:43,540
No one from the Academy

78
00:04:43,540 --> 00:04:45,800
Can so much as lay a finger on that witch

79
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:48,360
Anyway, I came to tell you

80
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,040
We have a Death Scythe mission for you

81
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,920
Time to get it together

82
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,920
Get back to work

83
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,760
Is that all you care about?

84
00:04:55,100 --> 00:04:56,800
You're not just a Death Scythe

85
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,240
You're his partner too

86
00:04:58,240 --> 00:05:00,600
How can you give up so easily?

87
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:03,960
He's been fighting all this time

88
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:06,260
Keeping the madness locked in

89
00:05:06,260 --> 00:05:14,560
Maybe he's stronger than you think he is, Marie

90
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:24,560
Impressive, Medusa

91
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:28,640
No witch has ever been able to strike a bargain with the Grim Reaper before

92
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,880
It's so simple now

93
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:32,600
All we do is sit and watch

94
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:35,320
Arachne and the Reaper will destroy each other

95
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:36,820
And we won't have to lift a finger

96
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:40,380
Of course, if the plan doesn't work

97
00:05:40,380 --> 00:05:42,620
Both of them will come looking for us

98
00:05:42,620 --> 00:05:44,300
And that could get ugly real quick

99
00:05:44,300 --> 00:05:48,400
The Reaper won't break the contract

100
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:49,540
He's too honorable

101
00:05:49,540 --> 00:05:51,140
And Arachne?

102
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:53,000
Well, the Kishin will destroy her

103
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,900
If the Reaper doesn't get to her first

104
00:05:54,900 --> 00:05:58,800
We just wait a little longer to make our move

105
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,840
Where are you off to this time?

106
00:06:03,140 --> 00:06:05,620
I've got a little appointment with my lover

107
00:06:05,620 --> 00:06:12,180
Twirl round and round

108
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:14,520
A new world in which the Doc dances?

109
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:27,840
Don't cry

110
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:31,600
If you can make it through this anguish

111
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:34,880
Happiness will be waiting on the other side

112
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:38,380
No matter how lost you feel

113
00:06:38,380 --> 00:06:40,380
There's always a way out

114
00:06:40,380 --> 00:06:43,760
Are you little girls lost in here too?

115
00:06:44,820 --> 00:06:46,340
What do you mean girls?

116
00:06:48,100 --> 00:06:49,320
It's just me

117
00:06:49,320 --> 00:06:50,980
I'm all alone with you

118
00:06:50,980 --> 00:06:54,260
Just you and me and that's okay

119
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:56,260
I came here to get you

120
00:06:56,260 --> 00:06:59,120
Come with me

121
00:06:59,120 --> 00:07:01,040
We'll follow the path

122
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:03,620
Pretty soon it'll lead us right out of here

123
00:07:03,620 --> 00:07:13,940
Can't you see she's a witch?

124
00:07:23,080 --> 00:07:25,100
You can't stay here forever, you know

125
00:07:25,100 --> 00:07:27,940
You have somebody waiting for you

126
00:07:27,940 --> 00:07:30,920
It's time for you to leave this place

127
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:33,080
But be careful of the witch

128
00:07:33,080 --> 00:07:35,520
If you let the madness take you

129
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:37,640
You'll never find the way out

130
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:41,000
But how do I leave?

131
00:07:41,380 --> 00:07:42,020
That's easy

132
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:45,700
All you have to do is think about where you're supposed to be

133
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:48,420
Where I'm supposed to be?

134
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:50,980
Who are you, kid?

135
00:07:56,580 --> 00:07:58,360
Zero reaction to magic

136
00:07:58,360 --> 00:08:00,280
It's as still as a stone

137
00:08:00,280 --> 00:08:04,420
I could use my wavelength to activate it

138
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:08,360
No, there's gotta be some trick to it

139
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:13,120
How am I supposed to think straight

140
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:15,040
When all I have to drink is this awful coffee

141
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:17,420
Now look what I've done

142
00:08:17,420 --> 00:08:19,020
The coffee's spilling everywhere

143
00:08:19,020 --> 00:08:23,560
What's that?

144
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:25,580
Way to go

145
00:08:25,580 --> 00:08:26,640
This is a breakthrough

146
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:29,120
Crafty Abon

147
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:31,740
Hiding a secret page right in the front cover

148
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:34,240
It's the information we're looking for

149
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:36,920
To activate Brew, we have to find the key

150
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:38,580
It's another magic tool

151
00:08:38,580 --> 00:08:40,920
We should send someone out immediately

152
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:42,840
Kid could handle the mission easily

153
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:45,200
Hmm

154
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:49,300
We're not exactly on the best terms right now

155
00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:51,540
I don't know if he'll take it on

156
00:08:51,540 --> 00:08:54,620
He's still suspicious about what we're planning with the tools

157
00:08:54,620 --> 00:08:58,820
Too much is going on for him to be acting like a petulant child

158
00:08:58,820 --> 00:09:02,100
You're his father, tell him he doesn't have a choice

159
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:03,880
There's one more thing

160
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:05,600
We need someone else

161
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:09,100
I'd like you to call on Uncle Bob for assistance

162
00:09:09,100 --> 00:09:11,940
Um, yeah

163
00:09:11,940 --> 00:09:14,060
Who's he again?

164
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,940
How could you forget?

165
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:18,820
He's the owner of the coffee shop nearby

166
00:09:18,820 --> 00:09:21,420
The only coffee so delicious it'll make you want to dance

167
00:09:21,420 --> 00:09:23,020
Come on everybody sing with me

168
00:09:23,020 --> 00:09:26,800
I'm falling apart at the seams without my mandaling coffee beans

169
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:27,360
Oh

170
00:09:27,360 --> 00:09:28,800
Mandolin?

171
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:30,300
Mandaling man

172
00:09:30,300 --> 00:09:34,860
I can't concentrate without Uncle Bob's rumba coffee

173
00:09:34,860 --> 00:09:37,740
I should have found that secret page long before now

174
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:41,300
If I keep going like this, my work will continue to suffer

175
00:09:41,300 --> 00:09:43,740
Now now, is it really that bad?

176
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:44,740
Yes

177
00:09:44,740 --> 00:09:48,740
Normally, I'd never pause to ask for outside help

178
00:09:48,740 --> 00:09:49,740
Pause?

179
00:09:49,740 --> 00:09:54,740
Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow

180
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:57,740
It smells so good I'm almost drooling

181
00:09:57,740 --> 00:10:03,740
Keep your pants on, lunch will be ready in just a few more minutes

182
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:05,740
We're calling this plate of chard fish lunch?

183
00:10:05,740 --> 00:10:08,740
Besides, isn't it Maka's turn to cook today anyway?

184
00:10:08,740 --> 00:10:09,740
Where is she?

185
00:10:09,740 --> 00:10:12,740
She locked herself in her room and she refuses to come out

186
00:10:12,740 --> 00:10:14,740
She should really eat some lunch though

187
00:10:14,740 --> 00:10:17,740
I'm sure a bite of my yummy fish would cheer her up

188
00:10:19,740 --> 00:10:21,740
So, give me a hand

189
00:10:21,740 --> 00:10:23,740
How about you be my taste tester?

190
00:10:23,740 --> 00:10:24,740
Huh?

191
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:26,740
Here, open up and say aww

192
00:10:26,740 --> 00:10:27,740
Ah

193
00:10:27,740 --> 00:10:29,740
Hey, what the hell?

194
00:10:35,740 --> 00:10:37,740
Huh?

195
00:10:37,740 --> 00:10:44,740
How could they let her go like that?

196
00:10:44,740 --> 00:10:50,740
After everything she's done to Professor Stein and Krona?

197
00:10:50,740 --> 00:10:54,740
I have to stop

198
00:10:54,740 --> 00:10:58,740
If I keep thinking about it, I'm gonna go mad too

199
00:10:58,740 --> 00:11:01,740
Mail for you

200
00:11:01,740 --> 00:11:02,740
Mail for you

201
00:11:09,740 --> 00:11:11,740
A postcard from Mama

202
00:11:11,740 --> 00:11:30,740
The place where I'm supposed to be, huh?

203
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:34,740
The place where I'm supposed to be, huh?

204
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:49,740
Come back here, Stein!

205
00:11:49,740 --> 00:11:58,740
The laboratory...

206
00:11:58,740 --> 00:12:07,740
It's a good thing I'm home now, but I still violated my curfew and ran off without telling anyone

207
00:12:07,740 --> 00:12:09,740
I wonder what excuse I should use

208
00:12:17,740 --> 00:12:19,740
Marie!

209
00:12:19,740 --> 00:12:32,740
What are you doing, Marie?

210
00:12:32,740 --> 00:12:33,740
From up here?

211
00:12:33,740 --> 00:12:35,740
The city looks so small

212
00:12:35,740 --> 00:12:38,740
Kind of like a prison floating in the clouds

213
00:12:38,740 --> 00:12:40,740
Don't you think?

214
00:12:40,740 --> 00:12:42,740
Somewhere out there

215
00:12:42,740 --> 00:12:44,740
I'm sure there's a world that will fit you better

216
00:12:44,740 --> 00:12:47,740
Goodbye, Stein

217
00:12:47,740 --> 00:12:48,740
Marie!

218
00:12:48,740 --> 00:12:49,740
Marie!

219
00:12:52,740 --> 00:12:55,740
Aw, looks like she died

220
00:12:55,740 --> 00:12:58,740
But wait, isn't that what you wanted?

221
00:12:59,740 --> 00:13:03,740
You never cared about her the way she cared about you

222
00:13:03,740 --> 00:13:06,740
Bye, Marie

223
00:13:10,740 --> 00:13:13,740
You went through the wrong exit

224
00:13:13,740 --> 00:13:16,740
The madness has taken over just like I thought it would

225
00:13:16,740 --> 00:13:18,740
What happened to Marie

226
00:13:18,740 --> 00:13:19,740
What happened to Marie?

227
00:13:19,740 --> 00:13:20,740
No need to worry

228
00:13:20,740 --> 00:13:22,740
You'll forget everything once I'm done with you

229
00:13:22,740 --> 00:13:24,740
Everyone you knew in your old life

230
00:13:24,740 --> 00:13:26,740
Even your own name

231
00:13:26,740 --> 00:13:29,740
What are you going to do to me?

232
00:13:29,740 --> 00:13:30,740
You have to be punished

233
00:13:30,740 --> 00:13:33,740
You broke the law and gave in to madness

234
00:13:33,740 --> 00:13:35,740
I need to cut you open and fix you up

235
00:13:35,740 --> 00:13:40,740
Stop it!No don't!

236
00:13:45,740 --> 00:13:47,740
So many pretty pictures

237
00:13:47,740 --> 00:13:50,740
Mama sent one to me every time she went somewhere new

238
00:13:50,740 --> 00:13:52,740
She hasn't sent one in a long time

239
00:13:52,740 --> 00:13:54,740
I've been kinda worried about her

240
00:13:54,740 --> 00:13:57,740
Your mom must be a pretty amazing lady

241
00:13:57,740 --> 00:14:00,740
A minute ago you were depressed

242
00:14:00,740 --> 00:14:02,740
But now you're all smiley

243
00:14:06,740 --> 00:14:07,740
Yeah

244
00:14:07,740 --> 00:14:11,740
So what place did she send you a postcard from this time?

245
00:14:11,740 --> 00:14:14,740
Hey, something's written in the corner

246
00:14:15,740 --> 00:14:17,740
You're right

247
00:14:17,740 --> 00:14:18,740
What is it?

248
00:14:18,740 --> 00:14:22,740
Hey, Maka

249
00:14:22,740 --> 00:14:28,740
Teaching is nothing but trouble

250
00:14:28,740 --> 00:14:31,740
I never thought I'd do it

251
00:14:31,740 --> 00:14:33,740
Look at me now

252
00:14:33,740 --> 00:14:35,740
These kids need someone to help them

253
00:14:35,740 --> 00:14:38,740
I don't think I can quit

254
00:14:40,740 --> 00:14:42,740
But you need me too Stein

255
00:14:42,740 --> 00:14:43,740
Don't you?

256
00:14:47,740 --> 00:14:49,740
Stop it!

257
00:14:49,740 --> 00:14:51,740
The kids can't see you like this

258
00:14:51,740 --> 00:15:08,740
Don't fight it Stein

259
00:15:08,740 --> 00:15:11,740
I'm giving you the chance to be reborn

260
00:15:11,740 --> 00:15:13,740
Let me cut you open

261
00:15:13,740 --> 00:15:15,740
Yes, a new world is waiting

262
00:15:15,740 --> 00:15:18,740
It's time for you to shed your fake skin

263
00:15:18,740 --> 00:15:20,740
Shut up!Shut up!Shut up!

264
00:15:20,740 --> 00:15:23,740
This is the fruit of life

265
00:15:23,740 --> 00:15:27,740
One bite of this and all your suffering will come to an end

266
00:15:27,740 --> 00:15:29,740
You'll feel much better

267
00:15:29,740 --> 00:15:38,740
Don't fall for it

268
00:15:38,740 --> 00:15:43,740
You were reaching for a shadow

269
00:15:43,740 --> 00:15:45,740
An illusion you created

270
00:15:45,740 --> 00:15:48,740
You

271
00:15:48,740 --> 00:15:50,740
I know you

272
00:15:50,740 --> 00:15:52,740
You're me

273
00:15:52,740 --> 00:15:57,740
I know you're nervous but there's no reason to be

274
00:15:57,740 --> 00:15:59,740
Go on, have a sip of your tea

275
00:16:00,740 --> 00:16:01,740
Um...

276
00:16:01,740 --> 00:16:04,740
Oh no, don't tell me you're a coffee drinker too

277
00:16:04,740 --> 00:16:08,740
I don't think I can handle any more tango or rumba or whatever

278
00:16:08,740 --> 00:16:11,740
I want to make a request

279
00:16:11,740 --> 00:16:13,740
Please sir

